---

<section id="how-it-works" class="how-section">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label">How it works</span>
      <h2>From search to spreadsheet<br><span class="accent-serif">in three steps</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="steps">

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">01</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Search</h3>
          <p>Enter your niche and location. "Plumbers in Austin" or "Dentists in Miami".</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-line"></div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">02</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Extract</h3>
          <p>Our engine scrapes results and finds decision-maker emails from 50+ sources.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-line"></div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">03</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Export</h3>
          <p>Download verified leads as CSV or sync directly to your CRM.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="section-cta">
      <a href="https://console.apify.com/actors/U1NdkcLzWXOfhQ7iM" target="_blank" class="cta-btn">
        Try Free — No Credit Card
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-section {
    padding: 8rem 0;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .accent-serif {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  /* Steps */
  .steps {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .step {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .step-number {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .step-content h3 {
    font-family: 'Cabinet Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .step-content p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 220px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .step-line {
    width: 60px;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .section-cta {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }

  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .steps {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .step-line {
      width: 1px;
      height: 40px;
      margin: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
